# The Crystal Spring (San d'Oria 3-2, mission.sandoria.the_crystal_spring). A level 30 Warrior of San d'Oria in Southern
# San d'Oria, 3-1 completed (none current), three Crystal Bass and a Pickaxe held. Endracion's own 1009; option 250
# nothing, option 111 begins the mission (no message). Status 0: Endracion and Ambrotien say ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET +
# 68. Trades to Ambrotien: a Pickaxe and two bass: his own 2008; one bass: 2030, whose finish takes it and sets status
# 2. Status 2: Ambrotien 2031, Endracion 1031. Status 1: Endracion's own 1001; one bass to him: 1030 (at any status),
# whose finish takes it and sets status 2.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Ambrotien/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Ambrotien/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/2009 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1013 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1030 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/2013 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/2030 NorthernSanDoria/Grilau/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Grilau/onTrade NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1013 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1030 ChateauDoraguille/Chalvatot/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/onZoneIn/1 ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/555 ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/556
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-110,1,-35 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren completed
mission Sandoria TheRescueDrill completed
mission Sandoria TheDavoiReport completed
mission Sandoria JourneyAbroad completed
mission Sandoria InfiltrateDavoi completed
item CrystalBass x3
item Pickaxe
login
trigger Endracion                       # section 1: 1009
finish option=250                       # not 111: nothing
trigger Endracion
finish option=111                       # begun
trigger Endracion                       # status 0: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 68
finish-if-event
trigger Ambrotien                       # ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 68
finish-if-event
walk 91,1,-57
trade Ambrotien Pickaxe x1              # not the bass: nothing
finish-if-event
trade Ambrotien CrystalBass x2          # two: nothing
finish-if-event
trade Ambrotien CrystalBass x1          # 2030
finish                                  # the bass taken, status 2
trigger Ambrotien                       # 2031
finish-if-event
trigger Endracion                       # 1031
finish-if-event
missionstatus Sandoria 1
trigger Endracion                       # status 1: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
walk -111,1,-36
trade Endracion CrystalBass x1          # 1030 at any status
finish                                  # the bass taken, status 2
